# Jian (slot 0) and Flora (slot 1) in the party, in the first Delrich Temple battle, for the skill plans.
# Both have their HP pinned to 999; their other stats are left as the save has them (level 1). Field
# records are 0x5C each from 0x020B4658: Jian's HP at 0x020B4668 / 0x020B466C; Flora's record is at
# 0x020B476C (level index +0x0C = 0x020B4778, HP +0x10 / +0x14, MP +0x18 / +0x1C). Battlers and stat
# records 0 and 1 are theirs in the battle. Built like party_rufus.plan (the pins are repeated because
# warp6 drops them).
include boot_from_save
pin u16 0x020B466C 999
pin u16 0x020B4668 999
pin u16 0x020B4780 999
pin u16 0x020B477C 999
pin u16 0x020B464C 0
pin u16 0x020B4650 3
pin u16 0x020B4654 65535
include warp6
pin u16 0x020B466C 999
pin u16 0x020B4668 999
pin u16 0x020B4780 999
pin u16 0x020B477C 999
pin u16 0x020B464C 0
pin u16 0x020B4650 3
pin u16 0x020B4654 65535
